{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.126357+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] received","args":["[notifications] received",{"type":"issue_created","receivedAt":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.125Z","issueId":"tskl-l82.9"}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.125Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/epics/","session_id":"akshkv7w"}}
{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.126613+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_created","issue_id":"tskl-l82.9","issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.9","title":"Deep link to specific comment within an issue via URL and CLI","description":"Given an agent has added a comment to an issue\n\nWhen the agent runs kbs console focus tskl-abc --comment 8ea9cd\n\nThen the CLI sends a notification through the server\nAnd the server pushes a URL route to all connected clients: /issues/tskl-abc?focused=tskl-abc&comment=8ea9cd\nAnd the browser navigates to that URL\nAnd the detail panel opens to the issue\nAnd the panel scrolls to the specified comment\nAnd the comment is visually highlighted\n\nGiven a user opens a URL with a comment parameter directly in their browser\n\nWhen the URL contains ?comment=8ea9cd\n\nThen the same scroll-to and highlight behavior occurs\n\nThis extends the URL-as-state model to sub-issue elements. The comment parameter is the first\nsuch element but the pattern should support future element types (e.g., a specific field change).\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- kbs console focus accepts an optional --comment <id> flag\n- Comment ID is encoded as ?comment=<id> query parameter in the URL\n- Frontend parses ?comment= on load and on SSE-pushed route changes\n- Detail panel scrolls to the comment and highlights it (existing highlight animation can be reused)\n- Works on initial page load (pasting URL) and on SSE push (agent workflow)","type":"story","status":"open","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[{"target":"tskl-l82","type":"parent-child"}],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.124149Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.124149Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T03:55:33.125Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/epics/","session_id":"akshkv7w"}}
