{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T03:57:11.103841+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82","fields_changed":["description"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82","title":"Organize and expand CLI commands for UI state inspection and control","description":"Make the console server a stateful orchestrator that pushes URL routes to connected browser clients. CLI commands (focus, search, view) flow through the server, which constructs a URL encoding the desired UI state and pushes it to all clients via SSE. The frontend navigates to whatever URL it receives. The URL is the universal state contract -- same mechanism works for local server (SSE), cloud (WebSocket), or pasting a link.\n\nNo backwards-compatibility logic. This is the only way it works.\n\nArchitecture:\n- Server pushes URL routes to clients via SSE (e.g., /issues/tskl-abc?focused=tskl-abc&comment=8ea9cd)\n- All UI state is URL-addressable: view mode (path), focused issue (query param), search (query param), comment (query param)\n- AppState holds a ConsoleUiState cache of the last-pushed route (for CLI query commands)\n- State persists to .kanbus/.cache/console_state.json across server restarts\n- CLI query commands (kbs console status, get focus, get view, get search) read from the cache\n- New SSE subscribers receive the last-pushed route on connect\n\nStories:\n1. Server maintains canonical UI state in memory (cache of last-pushed route)\n2. State persists to .kanbus/.cache/console_state.json across restarts\n3. kbs console status -- prints full state summary\n4. kbs console get focus -- prints focused issue ID or none\n5. kbs console get view -- prints current view mode or none\n6. kbs console get search -- prints active search query\n7. All UI state is URL-addressable (search, focus, view mode in the URL)\n8. New browser tabs receive last-pushed route on connect\n9. Deep link to specific comment within an issue","type":"epic","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":null,"labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-18T13:53:34.113606Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T03:57:11.096457Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T03:57:11.102Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/epics/","session_id":"akshkv7w"}}
