{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T03:57:46.820648+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82.2","fields_changed":["description"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.2","title":"Console server saves and restores UI state from .kanbus/.cache/console_state.json","description":"Given a console server that has been running with some UI state\n(e.g., an issue is focused, a view mode is set)\n\nWhen the server is stopped and restarted\n\nThen the server reads the last-pushed route from .kanbus/.cache/console_state.json at startup\nAnd replays that route to clients that connect via SSE\nAnd kbs console get focus returns the same focused issue as before the restart\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- ConsoleUiState (the cache of the last-pushed route) is persisted to .kanbus/.cache/console_state.json after every mutation\n- State is loaded from that file at server startup (file missing = default empty state, no error)\n- File format is JSON, human-readable\n- On restart, the restored state is replayed to new SSE subscribers as a route push","type":"story","status":"open","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:15:16.338693Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T03:57:46.810235Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T03:57:46.819Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/epics/","session_id":"akshkv7w"}}
