{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.940246+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82.3","fields_changed":["status"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.3","title":"kbs console status prints human-readable summary of all current UI state","description":"Given the console server is running with some UI state\n\nWhen I run kbs console status\n\nThen I see a human-readable summary showing:\n  - Whether an issue is currently focused (and which one)\n  - The current view mode (initiatives / epics / issues)\n  - The current search query (if any)\n\nWhen the console server is not running\n\nThen I see 'Console server is not running.' and the command exits 0\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Output is human-readable (not raw JSON)\n- All three state fields are shown, even if they are empty/default\n- No error exit code when server is offline -- just prints the 'not running' message","type":"story","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:15:22.632920Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.918517Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.939Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/issues/","session_id":"2tibkwq8"}}
{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.990265+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] received","args":["[notifications] received",{"type":"issue_updated","receivedAt":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.989Z","issueId":"tskl-l82.4"}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.989Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/issues/","session_id":"2tibkwq8"}}
{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.009503+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82.4","fields_changed":["status"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.4","title":"kbs console get focus prints currently focused issue ID or none","description":"Given the console server is running\nAnd an issue is currently focused (e.g., after kbs console focus tskl-abc)\n\nWhen I run kbs console get focus\n\nThen the command prints the focused issue ID (e.g., 'tskl-abc')\n\nGiven no issue is focused\n\nWhen I run kbs console get focus\n\nThen the command prints 'none'\n\nGiven the console server is not running\n\nWhen I run kbs console get focus\n\nThen the command prints 'Console server is not running.' and exits 0\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Output is a single line -- just the issue ID or 'none'\n- Suitable for use in shell scripts: $(kbs console get focus)\n- No error exit code when server is offline","type":"story","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:15:33.906328Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.972775Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T04:17:44.989Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/issues/","session_id":"2tibkwq8"}}
