{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.098867+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82.5","fields_changed":["status"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.5","title":"kbs console get view prints currently active view mode","description":"Given the console server is running\nAnd the view mode has been set (e.g., via kbs console view epics)\n\nWhen I run kbs console get view\n\nThen the command prints the current view mode (e.g., 'epics')\n\nGiven the server is running but view mode has never been explicitly set\n\nWhen I run kbs console get view\n\nThen the command prints 'none' (server has no opinion; browser uses its own default)\n\nGiven the console server is not running\n\nWhen I run kbs console get view\n\nThen the command prints 'Console server is not running.' and exits 0\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Valid output values: 'initiatives', 'epics', 'issues', or 'none'\n- No error exit code when server is offline","type":"story","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:15:39.161294Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.023384Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.037Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/issues/","session_id":"2tibkwq8"}}
