{"type":"telemetry","at":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.164879+00:00","payload":{"level":"info","message":"[notifications] full payload","args":["[notifications] full payload",{"notification":{"type":"issue_updated","issue_id":"tskl-l82.6","fields_changed":["status"],"issue_data":{"id":"tskl-l82.6","title":"kbs console get search prints active search query","description":"Given the console server is running\nAnd a search query is active (e.g., after kbs console search 'login bug')\n\nWhen I run kbs console get search\n\nThen the command prints the current search query (e.g., 'login bug')\n\nGiven no search query is active (search is clear)\n\nWhen I run kbs console get search\n\nThen the command prints 'none'\n\nGiven the console server is not running\n\nWhen I run kbs console get search\n\nThen the command prints 'Console server is not running.' and exits 0\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Output is a single line\n- No error exit code when server is offline","type":"story","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"assignee":null,"creator":"ryan.porter","parent":"tskl-l82","labels":[],"dependencies":[],"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-02-20T03:15:42.947246Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.150258Z","closed_at":null,"custom":{"beads_owner":"ryan.porter"}}},"hasIssueData":true}],"timestamp":"2026-02-20T04:17:45.164Z","url":"http://localhost:4242/issues/","session_id":"2tibkwq8"}}
